												<>
													<div>
														<>
															<span>{l("支持人數", "Students supported")}</span>
															<strong>{l("待確認", "Pending")}</strong>
														</>
													</div>
													<div>
														<>
															<span>{l("合作金額", "Partnership amount")}</span>
															<strong>{l("待確認", "Pending")}</strong>
														</>
													</div>
												</>
											</div>
											<p class="small">
												{l(
													"支持人數、每人補助上限與合作金額尚待確認。可先表達合作意願，本計畫不計入清單小計。",
													"Student capacity, individual funding limits, and partnership amounts are pending. Express your interest now; this program is excluded from the subtotal."
												)}
											</p>
											<h4>{l("規劃中的合作回饋", "Planned partner benefits")}</h4>
											<ul class="dream-benefits">
												<>
													<li>{l("SITCONTIX 售票系統曝光", "SITCONTIX ticketing visibility")}</li>
													<li>{l("新聞稿與社群內容", "Press and social content")}</li>
													<li>{l("網頁致謝與成果報告", "Website recognition and impact report")}</li>
												</>
											</ul>
											<p class="small">{l("呈現方式、次數與專屬權益範圍待確認。", "Placement, frequency, and exclusivity are subject to confirmation.")}</p>
											<button class="button primary" id="dream-select" aria-pressed="false">
												{l("加入開源築夢洽談需求", "Add student support to my inquiry")} ＋
											</button>
											<details>
												<>
													<summary>{l("計畫資格與完整說明", "Eligibility and program details")}</summary>
													<p>
														{l(
															"計畫針對符合經濟需求資格的學生，不限偏鄉。認定方式、補助上限、申請流程、名額，以及票券提供方式仍需行政組確認。企業合作方案、曝光形式與成果報告內容也將於洽談時確認。",
															"The program is intended for eligible students with financial needs, not only those from rural areas. Eligibility criteria, funding limits, application process, capacity, and ticket arrangements are pending organizer confirmation, as are partner benefits and reporting."
														)}
													</p>
												</>
											</details>
										</>
									</div>
								</>
							</div>
						</section>

						<section id="items" class="section-pad wrap">
							<div class="section-heading">
								<>
									<div>
										<>
											<p class="eyebrow">03 / MAKE IT YOURS</p>
											<h2>{l("多一點，剛好的連結。", "Add what makes it yours.")}</h2>
										</>
									</div>
									<p>
										{l(
											"依合作目標探索品項。價格直接看，細節再展開；適用方案與權益仍待確認，清單會保留這些洽談問題。",
											"Explore options by goal. See reference prices upfront and open the details when needed. Eligible plans and benefits are pending; your proposal keeps those questions visible."
										)}
									</p>
								</>
							</div>
							<div class="catalog-tools">
								<>
									<div class="filter-tabs" role="group" aria-label={l("品項分類", "Filter options")}>
										{[
											["all", l("全部", "All")],
											["talent", l("人才交流", "Talent")],
											["brand", l("品牌曝光", "Brand")],
											["product", l("產品推廣", "Product")],
											["included", l("權益候選", "Potential benefits")]
										].map(([value, label], i) => (
											<button data-filter={value} aria-pressed={i === 0}>
												{label}
											</button>
										))}
									</div>
									<label class="search-box">
										<>
											<span class="sr-only">{l("搜尋品項", "Search options")}</span>
											<span aria-hidden="true">⌕</span>
											<input type="search" id="item-search" placeholder={l("搜尋品項，例如：攤位", "Search, e.g. booth")} />
										</>
									</label>
								</>
							</div>
							<p class="catalog-caption" id="catalog-count" aria-live="polite" />
							<div class="catalog-grid">
								{items.map(item => (
									<article
										class="catalog-card"
										data-catalog-item={item.id}
										data-search={`${item.name} ${item.type} ${item.global_description}`}
										data-talent={item.talent_recruitment_order}
										data-brand={item.brand_exposure_order}
										data-product={item.product_promotion_order}
										data-package={String(item.quantity === "打包專屬")}
									>
										<a href={`${home}item/${item.id}/`} data-open-item={item.id} class="catalog-image">
											<img src={`${base}/items/${item.image}`} alt={item.image_description || item.name} width="400" height="250" loading="lazy" />
											<span>{item.quantity === "打包專屬" ? l("權益候選", "POTENTIAL BENEFIT") : item.type}</span>
										</a>
										<div class="catalog-content">
											<h3>
												<a href={`${home}item/${item.id}/`} data-open-item={item.id}>
													{item.name}
												</a>
											</h3>
											<p class="catalog-description">{item.global_description}</p>
											<div class="catalog-bottom">
												<div>
													<strong>{priceText(item)}</strong>
													<small>{l("2027 候選品項", "2027 candidate option")}</small>
												</div>
												<button data-open-item={item.id} class="round-button" aria-label={`${l("查看", "View")} ${item.name}`}>
													↗
												</button>
											</div>
										</div>
									</article>
								))}
							</div>
							<p id="no-results" class="empty-state" hidden>
								{l("沒有符合的品項，試試其他關鍵字或切回全部。", "No matching options. Try another term or choose All.")}
							</p>
							<button class="button secondary catalog-expand" id="catalog-expand">
								{l("顯示更多品項", "Show more options")} ↓
							</button>
							<p class="source-note">
								{l(
									"以下為 2027 合作候選品項，供需求討論。價格、適用方案、可用名額、製作規格與素材繳交期限均待確認，未沿用舊年度條件。",
									"These are candidate options for 2027 discussions. Pricing, eligible plans, availability, specifications, and artwork deadlines are pending; previous-year terms are not reused."
								)}
							</p>
						</section>
					</>
				)
			}

			<section id="proposal" class="proposal-section section-pad">
				<div class="wrap">
					<div class="print-identity">
						<h1>{l("SITCON 2027 合作討論清單", "SITCON 2027 partnership proposal")}</h1><p>contact@sitcon.org · {new URL(home, Astro.site || "https://sitcon.org").href}</p><p>
							{l("討論預覽版 · 非訂單或正式報價", "Discussion preview · not an order or formal quotation")}
						</p>
					</div><div class="section-heading">
						<div><p class="eyebrow">04 / YOUR PARTNERSHIP STARTS HERE</p><h2>{l("把想法，整理成下一步。", "Turn your ideas into a conversation.")}</h2></div><p>
							{
								l(
									"這是你的合作討論清單。可以調整、列印帶回內部討論，或與 SITCON 一起確認適合的組合。",
									"This is your discussion proposal. Edit it, print it for your team, or use it to explore the right fit with SITCON."
								)
							}
						</p>
					</div><div class="proposal-panel">
						<div id="proposal-lines"></div><div class="proposal-total">
							<div><span>{l("已列價項目參考小計", "Reference subtotal of priced items")}</span><strong id="proposal-total">NT$0</strong><p id="proposal-note"></p></div><div class="proposal-actions">
								<button class="button secondary" id="print-proposal">{l("列印／另存 PDF", "Print / Save PDF")} ↗</button><button class="button secondary" id="copy-proposal">
									{l("複製合作清單", "Copy proposal")}
								</button>{
									quoteOnly ? (
										<a class="button primary" href={`${home}#plans`}>
											{l("返回修改方案", "Edit proposal")}
										</a>
									) : (
										<a class="button primary" href="#contact">
											{l("帶著清單聊聊", "Discuss this proposal")} ↗
										</a>
									)
								}
							</div>
						</div><p class="reference-note">
							{
								l(
									"這份清單供洽談參考，不是訂單、正式報價或名額保留。最終價格、稅務／憑證處理及權益，以雙方確認的合作內容為準。",
									"This is a discussion aid, not an order, formal quotation, or reservation. Final pricing, tax and receipt arrangements, and benefits are subject to mutual confirmation."
								)
							}
						</p>
					</div><p class="status-message" id="proposal-status" role="status"></p>
				</div>
			</section>

			{
				!quoteOnly && (
					<section id="contact" class="contact-section section-pad wrap">
						<>
							<div class="contact-copy">
								<>
									<p class="eyebrow">LET’S BUILD SOMETHING TOGETHER</p>
									<h2>
										{l("你的目標，", "Your goals.")}
										<br />
										<em>{l("我們一起想。", "Our next conversation.")}</em>
									</h2>
									<p>
										{l(
											"不用先選好方案。告訴我們你想接觸的族群、合作目標或預算，我們會一起討論合適的方式。",
											"You don’t need a finished proposal. Tell us your audience, goals, or budget, and we can explore the options together."
										)}
									</p>
									<a class="contact-email" href="mailto:contact@sitcon.org">
										contact@sitcon.org ↗
									</a>
									<ol class="contact-steps">
										<>
											<li>
												<>
													<span>01</span>
													<div>
														<>
															<strong>{l("分享需求", "Share your goals")}</strong>
															<p>{l("將合作清單與問題寄給我們。", "Send us your proposal and questions.")}</p>
														</>
													</div>
												</>
											</li>
											<li>
												<>
													<span>02</span>
													<div>
														<>
															<strong>{l("一起確認合作內容", "Agree on the details")}</strong>
															<p>{l("討論方案、權益與執行時程。", "Discuss benefits, pricing, and timing.")}</p>
														</>
													</div>
												</>
											</li>
											<li>
												<>
													<span>03</span>
													<div>
														<>
															<strong>{l("確認合作，再準備素材", "Confirm, then prepare")}</strong>
															<p>{l("確認合作備忘錄及素材需求後執行。", "Confirm the agreement and artwork requirements.")}</p>
														</>
													</div>
												</>
											</li>
										</>
									</ol>
									<p class="personal-link">
										{l("想以個人身分支持？", "Looking to support us personally?")}{" "}
										<a href="https://sitcon.org/donate" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">
											{l("前往 SITCON 捐款頁面", "Visit SITCON donations")} ↗
										</a>
									</p>
								</>
							</div>
							<form id="inquiry-form" class="inquiry-form">
								<>
									<h3>{l("準備一封合作邀請", "Prepare your inquiry")}</h3>
									<p>{l("下方資料只用來在你的裝置產生信件草稿。開啟信箱後，請確認內容並自行寄出。", "These details only create a draft on your device. Review and send it in your email app.")}</p>
									<label>
										{l("單位名稱", "Organization")}{" "}
										<>
											<span>*</span>
											<input name="organization" autocomplete="organization" required maxlength="120" placeholder={l("公司、基金會或其他單位", "Company, foundation, or organization")} />
										</>
									</label>
									<div class="form-row">
										<>
											<label>
												{l("聯絡人", "Your name")}{" "}
												<>
													<span>*</span>
													<input name="name" autocomplete="name" required maxlength="80" />
												</>
											</label>
											<label>
												Email{" "}
												<>
													<span>*</span>
													<input type="email" name="email" autocomplete="email" required maxlength="150" />
												</>
											</label>
										</>
									</div>
									<label>
										{l("合作目標或想問的事", "Goals or questions")}
										<textarea
											name="message"
											rows="4"
											maxlength="2000"
											placeholder={l("例如：希望接觸實習人才，預算約 12 萬元。", "For example: meeting internship candidates, with a budget of NT$120,000.")}
										/>
