									<p class="form-cart-note">
										{l("目前合作清單會自動附在信件中；沒有選擇項目也可以聯絡。", "Your current proposal is included automatically. You can also contact us without selecting anything.")}
									</p>
									<button type="submit" class="button primary">
										{l("產生合作信件草稿", "Create email draft")} ↗
									</button>
									<div id="inquiry-result" hidden>
										<>
											<label for="inquiry-draft">{l("確認信件內容", "Review your draft")}</label>
											<textarea id="inquiry-draft" rows="10" readonly />
											<div class="form-row">
												<>
													<a class="button primary" id="open-email" href="mailto:contact@sitcon.org">
														{l("開啟郵件程式", "Open email app")} ↗
													</a>
													<button type="button" class="button secondary" id="copy-email">
														{l("複製信件內容", "Copy email text")}
													</button>
												</>
											</div>
											<p>
												{l(
													"尚未寄出。若沒有開啟郵件程式，請複製內容寄到 contact@sitcon.org。",
													"Nothing has been sent. If your email app does not open, copy the text and send it to contact@sitcon.org."
												)}
											</p>
										</>
									</div>
									<p id="inquiry-status" role="status" />
								</>
							</form>
						</>
					</section>
				)
			}
		</main>
		<footer class="site-footer">
			<div class="wrap">
				<div><a class="footer-brand" href={home}>SITCON <span>2027</span></a><p>{l("學生的舞台，與產業相遇。", "Where student ideas meet industry.")}</p></div><div>
					<a href="https://sitcon.org/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">{l("認識 SITCON", "About SITCON")} ↗</a><a
						href="https://sitcon.org/flickr-photo-finder/"
						target="_blank"
						rel="noopener noreferrer"
					>
						{l("歷年活動影像", "Community photos")} ↗
					</a><a href="mailto:contact@sitcon.org">contact@sitcon.org</a><a href={`${base}/photo-credits/`}>{l("影像來源", "Photo credits")}</a>
				</div>
			</div><div class="wrap footer-bottom"><span>STUDENTS’ INFORMATION TECHNOLOGY CONFERENCE</span><span>{l("2027 贊助徵求書・討論預覽", "2027 SPONSORSHIP · DISCUSSION PREVIEW")}</span></div>
		</footer>
		{
			!quoteOnly && (
				<a class="proposal-dock" href="#proposal">
					<>
						<span>
							{l("合作清單", "Your proposal")} <b id="dock-count">0</b>
						</span>
						<strong id="dock-total">{l("尚未選擇", "Start exploring")}</strong>
						<span aria-hidden="true">↗</span>
					</>
				</a>
			)
		}
		<div class="sr-only" id="selection-status" role="status"></div>
		{
			!quoteOnly &&
				items.map(item => (
					<dialog class="item-dialog" id={`item-${item.id}`} aria-labelledby={`item-title-${item.id}`} data-item-dialog={item.id}>
						<>
							<button class="dialog-close" aria-label={l("關閉品項詳情", "Close item details")}>
								×
							</button>
							<div class="dialog-scroll">
								<>
									<img class="dialog-photo" src={`${base}/items/${item.image}`} alt={item.image_description || item.name} width="800" height="400" loading="lazy" />
									<div class="dialog-content">
										<>
											<p class="eyebrow">{item.type}</p>
											<h2 id={`item-title-${item.id}`}>{item.name}</h2>
											<div class="item-description" set:html={marked.parse(item.global_description)} />
											<p class="reference-note">
												{l(
													"以下為參考內容；2027 價格、名額、截止日與製作規格需另行確認。",
													"Reference content. 2027 pricing, availability, deadlines, and production specifications require confirmation."
												)}
											</p>
											<div class="item-choices">
												{(item.sub.length ? item.sub.map((sub, i) => ({ id: `${item.id}-sub-${i}`, name: sub.name, price: sub.price })) : [{ id: item.id, name: item.name, price: item.price }]).map(
													option => (
														<div class="item-choice">
															<div>
																<h3>{option.name}</h3>
																<p>{displayPrice(option.price)}</p>
																<span data-option-status={option.id} />
															</div>
															<button class="button secondary" data-option={option.id} aria-pressed="false">
																{l("加入清單", "Add to proposal")} ＋
															</button>
														</div>
													)
												)}
											</div>
											<p class="small">
												{l(
													"需要準備的素材與執行規格，請在洽談時依品項確認；例如 Logo、廣告文案、圖檔尺寸及繳交時間。",
													"Discuss artwork and delivery requirements for each option, including logos, copy, dimensions, and submission dates."
												)}
											</p>
											<a class="text-link" href="#proposal" data-close-to-proposal>
												{l("檢視合作清單", "View proposal")} ↗
											</a>
										</>
									</div>
								</>
							</div>
						</>
					</dialog>
				))
		}
		<script src="../../scripts/cfs.ts"></script>
	</body>
</html>
